 flow has compounded -25.2% a year over five years, short of the 5% durability bar.","Capex roughly matches depreciation (0.9x, 2.2% of sales), a maintenance pace.","Its Rule of 40 score is 10, below the 40 that marks a healthy growth business.","It has beaten earnings estimates by 7.7% on average."],"own":["Insiders own a modest 4.9%, and institutions hold 87%.","Insiders have only sold over the past year (9 sales, net $1.4M sold).","It returns 2.8% a year to shareholders (3.0% in dividends).","It has paid a dividend for 16 consecutive years, raising it 19.4% a year over the last five."],"people":["With about 5,700 employees, each generates about $314K of revenue, 0.8x the Consumer Cyclical median, and revenue has grown 5.3% a year across its filed history.","That works out to $3K of free cash flow per employee.","CEO pay is $1.9M (6x revenue per employee), and compensation governance scores well (3/10, lower is better).","Stock compensation averages $1K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"WATCH","conv":48,"head":"Watch: priced 29% above its $34.04 fair value, but that value is low-confidence and the price is inside its $19.86\u2013$56.87 range.","pros":["Revenue grew 9.7%/yr over 5y","Piotroski F-score 7/9","P/E 10.9x vs sector 18.8x","EV/EBITDA 6.0x vs sector 10.7x","3 analysts' mean target $50.67 (+15%)"],"cons":["Trades 29% above fair value of $34.04","Net debt/EBITDA 3.4x","Fair value is low-confidence (wide Monte Carlo spread)","P/FCF 52.6x vs sector 16.7x"],"flags":[],"need":["its composite (37) is below 39","no margin of safety","the fair value is low-confidence (wide Monte Carlo spread)","too few checks pass (conviction 48)"],"buy_below":28.93,"vc":{"base":34.04,"base_src":"dcf","bear":19.86,"bull":56.87,"alt_median":25.26,"n_alt":3,"gap":0.4968,"dispersion":0.2229,"level":"LOW","why":["Monte Carlo spread is wide"]},"med":{"pe":18.8184,"ev_ebitda":10.707,"pfcf":16.6971,"pb":2.3,"roic":0.1268,"gross_margin":0.346,"fcf_margin":0.0621,"div_yield":0.0232}},"mc_qu